  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Sustainable Investment and Infrastructure Programme - Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to promote sustainable investment in sustainable infrastructure projects in sub-Saharan Africa, by 
&#x2022; Lobbying regional institutions, national governments, companies and financial institutions in China and Africa for better legislation, policies and plans and their implementation, to drive sustainable finance and infrastructure.
&#x2022; Piloting nature-based solution projects and monitoring practices</narrative>
  </description>
